                <!-- Waste Movements Section -->
                <div>
                    <h4 style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;">
                        <span><i class="fa-solid fa-clipboard-list me-1 text-red"></i> حركات الإهلاك المسجلة لهذه الدفعة (@selectedBatchWasteItems.Count)</span>
                        @if (selectedBatchWasteItems.Any())
                        {
                            <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--accent-red); font-weight: 800;">
